        "TileImage": "$($repository ff7d3a6c-f9e3-4941-9499-802f6bcf6971).Image",
        "Description": "My suspicions were correct, 56. The Kamera ARE planning  something revolving around technology. I&apos;ve managed to track signals and crypto transactions to a militia base in Colorado. Apparently their computer technicians and hackers have been feeding intel to the Kamera. But look at how much data&apos;s been hoarded. Look at the extensive planning. This feels like the beginning of a global cyber attack. But who could be launching this attack? Find out, 56. I won&apos;t care for collateral. Godspeed.\r-V",
